 "description": "Convert a digital storage size between units. Units: B (bytes), KB, MB, GB, TB. By default 1 KB = 1000 bytes (decimal, as storage is sold). Set binary to true for 1 KB = 1024 bytes (as Windows reports drive sizes). Source: https://hopi.co.uk/data-size-converter/",
